PC Number: 2009-0889Date: 2009-06-04


Whereas Assistant Commissioner Michael Norman Saunders, promoted to that rank by Order in Council P.C. 2007-1949 of December 13, 2007, has applied for voluntary retirement from the Royal Canadian Mounted Police, effective midnight July 18, 2008;


 


And whereas, pursuant to subsection 23(1) of the Royal Canadian Mounted Police Regulations, 1988, the Commissioner of the Royal Canadian Mounted Police has forwarded a recommendation to the Minister of Public Safety and Emergency Preparedness for the administrative discharge from the Royal Canadian Mounted Police of Assistant Commissioner Michael Norman Saunders on 
the grounds of voluntary retirement as specified in paragraph 19(d) of the Royal Canadian Mounted Police Regulations, 1988, effective midnight July 18, 2008;


 


