Therefore, His Excellency the Governor General in Council, on the recommendation of the Minister of Canadian Heritage, pursuant to section 67 of the Constitution Act, 1867, hereby


 


(a) terminates the appointment of the Honourable Warren K. Winkler as Administrator of the Government of Ontario, effective October 19, 2011;


 


(b) appoints the Honourable Heather J. Smith to be Administrator of the Government of Ontario, to execute the office and functions of the Lieutenant Governor of Ontario during the absence, illness or other inability of the Lieutenant Governor, effective October 19, 2011;


 


(c) terminates the appointment of the Honourable Heather J. Smith as Administrator of the Government of Ontario, effective October 22, 2011; 


 


(d) appoints the Honourable Warren K. Winkler to be Administrator of the Government of Ontario, to execute the office and functions of the Lieutenant Governor of Ontario during the absence, illness or other inability of the Lieutenant Governor, effective October 22, 2011;


 


 


