(c) terminates the appointment of the Honourable Heather J. Smith as Administrator of the Government of Ontario, effective May 19, 2012; 


 


(d) appoints the Honourable Warren K. Winkler to be Administrator of the Government of Ontario, to execute the office and functions of the Lieutenant Governor of Ontario during the absence, illness or other inability of the Lieutenant Governor, effective May 19, 2012;


 


 


 


 


 


