(g) terminates the appointment of the Honourable Heather J. Smith as Administrator of the Government of Ontario, effective September 1, 2012; 


 


(h) appoints the Honourable Dennis R. O’Connor to be Administrator of the Government of Ontario, to execute the office and functions of the Lieutenant Governor of Ontario during the absence, illness or other inability of the Lieutenant Governor, effective September 1, 2012;


 


(i) terminates the appointment of the Honourable 


Dennis R. O’Connor as Administrator of the Government 


of Ontario, effective September 8, 2012; and


 


(j) appoints the Honourable Warren K. Winkler to be Administrator of the Government of Ontario, to execute the office and functions of the Lieutenant Governor of Ontario during the absence, illness or other inability of the Lieutenant Governor, effective 


September 8, 2012.



