(b) appoints the Honourable Jamie W.S. Saunders to be Administrator of the Government of Nova Scotia, to execute the office and functions of the Lieutenant Governor of Nova Scotia during the absence, illness or other inability of the Lieutenant Governor, effective July 27, 2012;


 


