	 	 And whereas paragraph 82(3)(c) of the Canada Pension Plan provides that there are members of the panel from every region of Canada; 


 


	 	 Therefore, His Excellency the Governor General in Council, on the recommendation of the Minister of Human Resources and Skills Development, pursuant to section 82 of the Canada Pension Plan, re-appoints 
James Ian MacSween of Red Deer, Alberta, as a member of the Review Tribunal for the region of Red Deer for a term of two years. 


 



