PC Number: 2013-0358Date: 2013-03-28


Whereas the Honourable David S. Crane, a Judge of the Superior Court of Justice in and for the Province of Ontario, will attain the age of seventy-five years on May 23, 2013, and, therefore, will cease to hold office on that date under the provisions of subsection 99(2) of the Constitution Act, 1867;


 


And whereas the Honourable David S. Crane has held judicial office for at least ten years;


 


Therefore, His Excellency the Governor General in Council, on the recommendation of the Minister of Justice, pursuant to paragraph 42(1)(d) of the Judges Act, grants an annuity of $192,066.66 to the Honourable David S. Crane, commencing on May 23, 2013, and continuing during his life.



Attendu que l’honorable David S. Crane, juge de la Cour supérieure de justice de l’Ontario, atteindra l’âge de soixante-quinze ans le 23 mai 2013 et que, en conséquence, il cessera d’occuper son poste à cette date en application du paragraphe 99(2) de la Loi constitutionnelle de 1867;


 


