PC Number: 2013-0886Date: 2013-08-06


Whereas the Administrator of the Government of Nova Scotia, the Honourable J. Michael MacDonald, Chief Justice of Nova Scotia, will be unable to act on August 6, 2013, and it is therefore necessary that another person be appointed Administrator;


 


Therefore, His Excellency the Governor General in Council, on the recommendation of the Minister of Canadian Heritage, pursuant to section 67 of the Constitution Act, 1867,


 


(a)	 
terminates the appointment of 


the Honourable J. Michael MacDonald as Administrator of the Government of Nova Scotia, effective August 6, 2013;


 


(b) appoints the Honourable Jamie W.S. Saunders to be Administrator of the Government of Nova Scotia, to execute the office and functions of the Lieutenant Governor of Nova Scotia during the absence, illness or other inability of the Lieutenant Governor, effective August 6, 2013;


 


(c) terminates the appointment of the Honourable Jamie W.S. Saunders as Administrator of the Government of Nova Scotia, effective August 7, 2013; and


 


(d) appoints the Honourable J. Michael MacDonald to be Administrator of the Government of Nova Scotia, to execute the office and functions of the Lieutenant Governor of Nova Scotia during the absence, illness or other inability of the Lieutenant Governor, effective on August 7, 2013.



