Therefore, His Excellency the Governor General in Council, on the recommendation of the Minister of Canadian Heritage, pursuant to section 67 of the Constitution Act, 1867


 


(a) terminates the appointment of the Honourable Robert J. Bauman as Administrator of the Government of British Columbia, effective November 15, 2013;


 


(b) appoints the Honourable Keith Bracken to be Administrator of the Government of British Columbia, to execute the office and functions of the Lieutenant Governor of British Columbia during the absence, illness or other inability of the Lieutenant Governor, effective November 15, 2013;


 


(c) terminates the appointment of the Honourable Keith Bracken as Administrator of the Government of British Columbia, effective November 18, 2013;


 


(d) appoints the Honourable Geoffrey Gaul to be Administrator of the Government of British Columbia, to execute the office and functions of the Lieutenant Governor of British Columbia during the absence, illness or other inability of the Lieutenant Governor, effective November 18, 2013;


 


 



- 2 -


 


