Therefore, His Excellency the Governor General in Council, on the recommendation of the Minister of Canadian Heritage, pursuant to section 67 of the Constitution Act, 1867


 


(a) terminates the appointment of the Honourable Richard J. Chartier as Administrator of the Government of Manitoba, effective April 7, 2014;


 


(b) appoints the Honourable Michel A. Monnin to be Administrator of the Government of Manitoba, to execute the office and functions of the Lieutenant Governor of Manitoba during the absence, illness or other inability of the Lieutenant Governor, effective April 7, 2014;


 


