PC Number: 2014-1353Date: 2014-11-27


	 	 His Excellency the Governor General in Council, on the recommendation of the Minister of Labour:


 


(a)	 
pursuant to paragraph 9(2)(b) and subsection 10(1) of the Canada Labour Code, appoints Annie Berthiaume of Ottawa, Ontario, to be a Vice-Chairperson of the Canada Industrial Relations Board, to hold office during good behaviour for a term of five years, on a full-time basis; 


 


