Whereas the Governor in Council is of the opinion that there is no longer an outbreak of Ebola virus disease in Guinea;


 

Therefore, His Excellency the Governor General in Council, on the recommendation of the Minister of Health, pursuant to section 58 of the Quarantine Act, makes the annexed Order Repealing the Minimizing the Risk of Exposure to Ebola Virus Disease in Canada Order (No. 4).



 

