And whereas section 12.8.9 of the Agreement provides that each member shall be appointed for a term not to exceed five years and may be reappointed; 

 

Therefore, Her Excellency the Governor General in Council, on the recommendation of the Minister of Indian Affairs and Northern Development, pursuant to section 6 of the Gwich’in Land Claim Settlement Act and paragraph 12.8.3(a) and section 12.8.9 of the Agreement, appoints Charlie Snowshoe of Fort McPherson, Northwest Territories, to be an alternate member of the Gwich’in Renewable Resources Board, for a term of five years.

 


Attendu que l’Entente sur la revendication territoriale globale des Gwich’in (l’« Entente ») a été approuvée, mise en vigueur et déclarée valide en vertu du paragraphe 4(1) de la Loi sur le règlement de la revendication territoriale des Gwich’in; 

 

