Whereas the Canadian Bar Association has nominated Jennifer Zdriluk to be a member of the Independent Judicial Advisory Committee for the Province of Ontario - West and South;

  

Therefore, Her Excellency the Governor General in Council, on the recommendation of the Minister of Justice, under Order in Council P.C. 2017-10 of January 19, 2017, appoints Jennifer Zdriluk of Burlington, Ontario, to be a member of the Independent Judicial Advisory Committee for the Province of Ontario - West and South, to hold office during pleasure for a term of three years.



 

